Package: TDMM
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Time-Dynamic Models with Optional Mixed Effects
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Makena", "Grigsby", email = "makenavgrigsby@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Esra", "Kürüm", email = "esra.kurum@ucr.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Fits Bayesian time-dynamic models with optional mixed effects for Gaussian,
    Bernoulli, and Poisson outcomes. Regression coefficients are modeled as
    smooth functions of time. Models may include a subject-specific random
    intercept for repeated observations or omit it for independent observations.
    For independent observations, time may represent age, time since an event,
    or time relative to an event. Posterior computation uses JAGS.
